WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
- Also you're singing with
one of my other favorites,

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.799
Dolly, "Seasons."
- Dolly Parton, yeah.

00:00:04.799 --> 00:00:07.761
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.761 --> 00:00:10.050
- There is a part of the
song where I swear to you,

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.570
I was like, your vibratos
almost sounds similar.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:13.980
There's a part where
you're just like, "Wait,

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.570
which one is which at one point?"

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.010
In the song, when I was listening.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.630
How did that come about?

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:22.020
- I tried like, hitting
up her manager a lot.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.930
- Because she doesn't,
y'all, she still sends faxes.

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.330
I'm not kidding.
- Oh yeah.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.790
- It's hard, you gotta
send a bird for that one.

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:30.623
It's like a pigeon.

00:00:30.623 --> 00:00:33.300
- So they were like, "Hey, okay, sure,

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.190
send us a song, but we need it on a CD."

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.330
And I was like, "I don't have,

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.003
I don't know how to make, like,

00:00:38.003 --> 00:00:40.557
I don't remember how to make the CD."

00:00:40.557 --> 00:00:41.390
(Kelly laughs)
- I know, I'm telling you,

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.530
that's so funny 'cause I've
done something with her.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:44.363
- But she's so sweet.

00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:46.050
I had another song prior to this one.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:47.250
- Yeah.
- And I was talking about,

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.240
it was a song about heaven

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.680
and hell and stuff like that.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.880
And she was like, she wrote
me a handwritten letter.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:54.713
- Totally her.

00:00:54.713 --> 00:00:57.090
- And telling me why she
doesn't wanna sing about hell

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.650
'cause, you know, heaven and hell like,

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:01.620
she doesn't wanna like,
she doesn't wanna say...

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.090
- She didn't wanna invest in
that kind of conversation.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:05.610
- Yeah, she didn't wanna
go into that energy.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:07.560
So then I sent her "Seasons."
- Yeah.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:08.550
- And she loved it.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.010
And then a week later
she sent me her verse.

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:12.930
- Well, "Seasons" sounds like something

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:13.763
she would've recorded.

00:01:13.763 --> 00:01:15.780
That's why it's so perfect
how that worked out.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.600
And way to go for her
being honest and polite,

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.277
like sending you something-
- She is the nicest.

00:01:20.277 --> 00:01:21.540
- Yeah.
- She is one of

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.790
the nicest people I've ever met.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:25.530
And she is the funniest.

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:27.330
- So funny.
- She said she would adopt me.

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:29.455
So wherever the camera is right now.

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:30.660
(Kelly chuckling)
Dolly,

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:32.400
you said you were gonna adopt me and-

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.110
- You don't look far off.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.240
It's like beautiful bombshell.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:39.115
- I mean I wish, I mean, sorry mom.

00:01:39.115 --> 00:01:40.110
(everyone laughing)

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:42.150
- She does not wish that. (chuckles)

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:44.670
- No, but she's such an icon.

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:47.040
Like, she's like, not only just an artist

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.360
but she was a songwriter.

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.200
She wrote, "I Will Always
Love You" by Whitney.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:51.337
So many more songs.
- "Coat of Many Colors,"

00:01:51.337 --> 00:01:52.470
"Jolene," all of songs.
- So we shot

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:55.728
a music video together, which
is coming out today as well.

00:01:55.728 --> 00:01:56.702
(audience applauding)

00:01:56.702 --> 00:01:59.374
- And I'll tell you
what, she shows up ready.

00:01:59.374 --> 00:02:00.207
She shows up ready.
- Oh, girl!

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.150
Girl, she put me to shame.

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:04.440
Let me tell you.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:05.550
I thought I looked good.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.660
I was like, "Okay, I feel good.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.130
I have my corset on, my heels."

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:09.900
She showed up in six inch heels.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.820
- Yep.
- Six inch heels.

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:14.482
A corset, her (beep) were like this high.

00:02:14.482 --> 00:02:16.440
(Kelly chuckling)

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:17.760
And she was ready to go.

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:19.410
She's like, "Whatever you need, let's go.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.400
Let's get this done."

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.650
- She's so professional.
- She's so professional.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:23.683
- Yeah, so many lessons-
- But I didn't ask her,

00:02:23.683 --> 00:02:25.170
I wanted to ask her something
and I forgot, I chickened out.

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.460
