00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.040
- I wanted to see if she had tattoos.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.210
- You know, here's the thing, people,

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.910
it's been a thing 'cause she's
always got her arms covered.

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:35.010
People have always said she has tattoos.

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.600
I've never seen this either.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:37.433
- That's my goal.

00:02:37.433 --> 00:02:38.792
I'm gonna find out.

00:02:38.792 --> 00:02:39.625
(audience chuckling)

00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:40.740
- I don't know if I wanna know.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:41.940
- Okay.
- I kind of,

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:42.990
I think I don't wanna know

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:46.110
