got full sleeves. (chuckles)

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:48.360
Like, I wanna pretend that
Dolly Parton has full sleeves

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:51.090
and it's just like just has a Harley

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:54.330
and it's just like on weekends
just roaming the planet.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:55.163
Yeah.

00:02:55.163 --> 00:02:57.060
Yeah, that's what I need
to know, in my brain.

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:58.170
Anyway, I love her.

00:02:58.170 --> 00:02:59.310
I love "Seasons" though.

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:01.230
It's a damn great song.
- Thank you.

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:02.520
